# 统一文本换行：仓库内文本文件一律 LF（Windows 检出同样保持 LF）。
# 原因：CRLF 会让 design:check 的 front-matter 解析、vitest 快照与 Prettier 门禁在
# Windows 检出/合并后出现平台相关失败；仓库 blob 已为 LF，这里固定检出行为。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.jar binary
